_commemorative_march_on_Forward_Operating_Base_Warrior%2C_Kirkuk%2C_Iraq%2C_Sept._11._The_march_gave_Soldiers_the_opportunity_to_reflect.jpg/330px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Soldiers bow their heads during a moment of silence before going on a commemorative march on Forward Operating Base Warrior, Kirkuk, Iraq, September 11. The march gave the opportunity to reflect on the tragedy that happened eight years prior.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUS_Army_51759_Soldiers_bow_their_heads_during_a_moment_of_silence_before_going_on_a_commemorative_march_on_Forward_Operating_Base_Warrior%2C_Kirkuk%2C_Iraq%2C_Sept._11._The_march_gave_Soldiers_the_opportunity_to_reflect.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Bach_from_St_Matthew_Passion.png/500px-Bach_from_St_Matthew_Passion.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Bach_from_St_Matthew_Passion.png/1280px-Bach_from_St_Matthew_Passion.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Bach_from_St_Matthew_Passion.png/500px-Bach_from_St_Matthew_Passion.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"\"Sind Blitze, sind Donner\" (chorus) from the St. Matthew Passion.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABach_from_St_Matthew_Passion.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Handel%2C_Hallelujah_Chorus_closing_bars.png/500px-Handel%2C_Hallelujah_Chorus_closing_bars.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Handel%2C_Hallelujah_Chorus_closing_bars.png/1280px-Handel%2C_Hallelujah_Chorus_closing_bars.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"